					<tag xmi:id="EAID_E4EE276D_7727_6777_9F27_6680D1082811" name="definition (en)" value="&lt;memo&gt;#NOTES#A specific representation of a dataset. A dataset might be available in multiple serializations that may differ in various ways, including natural language, media-type or format, schematic organization, temporal and spatial resolution, level of detail or profiles (which might specify " modelElement="EAID_AF4FCC52_226A_B288_9A3C_0C2AA8275CFD"/>
